                representing a <strong>{growth_vs_2019:.0f}% increase</strong> compared to the 2015–2019 annual average of {avg_pre_2020:.0f} satellites/year.
            </div>

            <div class="two-col">
                <div>
                    <h3>Year-over-Year Growth</h3>
